 class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2844910/extras/3d1c02b1af0ac53ca5768765b50f2b30.poster.avif?t=1733753270\" width=800 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2844910/extras/3d1c02b1af0ac53ca5768765b50f2b30.webm?t=1733753270\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2844910/extras/3d1c02b1af0ac53ca5768765b50f2b30.mp4?t=1733753270\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Innovative Design Tools at Your Fingertips</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a new world of interior design with our <strong>cutting-edge tools that redefine the way you shape your virtual spaces</strong>. Interior Designer boasts a wide array of intuitive functionalities, offering tools such as automated roof creation, stretchable furniture, adjustable lighting, and dynamic cabinets. Break free from conventional constraints and let your imagination run wild as you effortlessly manipulate every aspect of your interiors. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2844910/extras/4bedb412077d379cdc4fdf11d2c4dbf9.poster.avif?t=1733753270\" width=610 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2844910/extras/4bedb412077d379cdc4fdf11d2c4dbf9.webm?t=1733753270\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2844910/extras/4bedb412077d379cdc4fdf11d2c4dbf9.mp4?t=1733753270\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It's not just a game; it's a design revolution.</strong></p>",
